        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>House of Peru is a non profit organization 501(c)3. We are part of a group of other 33 houses located in beautiful Balboa Park and registered under "The House of Pacific Relations" established in the city of San Diego in 1935. We maintain the home/building and share the experience with the public.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
