      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>House of Peru Lawn Program: We had the presence of the Peruvian Consul in Los Angeles Jos Luis Chvez, members of Pro Marina Filial San Diego C. de F. Carlos Chaparro Sagarnaga, C. de F. Carlos Nalvarte Vizcarra and the representative of the Marina de Guerra del Per en San Diego, C. de F. Nelson Pinzas Vargas. The program was animated by Peruvian singer Rosa Los Santos accompanied by the professional percussionist Ryan Chesire, who got the hearts of everyone singing emblematic Peruvian songs and making everyone dance on stage! We had an amazing time with music, dance, food, raffles, and vendors, but more importantly, sharing our love for Peru.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
